26. JOB LIFECYCLE
Every asynchronous operation follows:
REQUEST
 ↓
JOB CREATED
 ↓
QUEUED
 ↓
RUNNING
 ↓
VALIDATING
 ↓
COMPLETED
Failure states:
FAILED
CANCELLED
Jobs must be idempotent wherever practical.

27. JOB OWNERSHIP
Every job shall record:
