61. EVENT OUTBOX
To prevent loss of events between database commit and message publication, the implementation shall use an Outbox pattern.
Conceptually:
DATABASE TRANSACTION
    ↓
MODEL CHANGE
    +
OUTBOX EVENT
    ↓
COMMIT
    ↓
OUTBOX PUBLISHER
    ↓
MESSAGE QUEUE
This provides reliable event publication.

62. API IDEMPOTENCY
